# SlugBase

A bookmark manager with built-in URL shortening and keyboard-driven launcher — save bookmarks, assign short slugs, and jump to any URL from the address bar or command palette (`/go/<slug>`). Shipped as **CE** (public AGPL self-host) and **Cloud** (private MDG Labs managed service) via an **open-core three-repo** split.

## Three-repository open-core model

| Repo | Visibility | Role |
|---|---|---|
| [`slugbase`](https://github.com/mdg-labs/slugbase) | Public (AGPL-3.0) | CE: `backend`, `web`, `ui`, `shared-types`, `email-templates` |
| [`slugbase-cloud`](https://github.com/mdg-labs/slugbase-cloud) | Private | Cloud: `admin`, `db-admin`, `marketing`, `cloud-api`, `slugbase-billing`, deploy |
| [`commerce`](https://github.com/mdg-labs/commerce) | Private | Shared billing: `@mdg-labs/commerce-core`, `@mdg-labs/commerce-mollie` |

**Cursor workspace roots** (siblings under `/home/mdguggenbichler/projects/`): `slugbase` · `slugbase-cloud` · `commerce` · `slugbase-docs`. Open `slugbase.code-workspace`. Orchestrator primary checkout: **`slugbase`** on `staging`.

Cloud extends CE via optional NestJS modules + private npm packages — **no** `isCloud` / `SLUGBASE_MODE` / edition branches in product logic (spec §15). CE uses noop billing (full entitlements); Cloud uses Mollie via `slugbase-billing` + `commerce-*`.

Plan file for the split: `docs/internal/open-core-refactor-plan.md`.

## Tech stack (settled — spec §19, decisions #37–#50)

- **Three pnpm workspaces** — one per repo; Turborepo task pipelines in each (spec §2.2, §19)
- **Language:** **TypeScript** (strict, no `any`) everywhere (spec §19, decision #37)
- **Backend:** **NestJS** — CE in `slugbase/packages/backend`; Cloud API extensions in `slugbase-cloud/packages/cloud-api`
- **Web client:** **React Router v7** (framework mode) — `slugbase/packages/web`; Node SSR container on Cloud (Coolify) and CE (`slugbase-web` image) — spec §19, §14.7
- **Marketing:** **Astro** (static) in **`slugbase-cloud/packages/marketing`** — nginx container on Coolify — spec §2.3, §19
- **Persistence:** **Drizzle ORM** + **Drizzle Kit**; **PostgreSQL** (operator-hosted Postgres for Cloud + CE). Embedded SQLite for CE is **deferred** (Fast-Follow) — spec §11.9, §16
- **Contracts/validation:** **Zod** + **ts-rest** in `shared-types`; generates the OpenAPI description — spec §18, §19
- **UI:** **Tailwind** (token-bridged) + **Radix** + **cmdk** — spec §23; `@slugbase/ui` published on npmjs
- **Tests:** **Vitest** + **Supertest** (unit/integration) + **Playwright** (e2e) — spec §22.4
- **CE packages:** `backend` · `web` · `shared-types` · `ui` · `email-templates` (spec §19)
- **Auth:** server-side sessions (DB-backed, no JWT access/refresh); TOTP MFA (otplib); OIDC/SSO; **argon2id**; double-submit CSRF — spec §5
- **Billing:** Mollie via `commerce` + `slugbase-billing` (Cloud); noop billing (CE) — spec §11.4
- **AI:** **OpenAI** behind the vendor-neutral AI interface — spec §11.2, decision #49
- **i18n:** English + German; repo-JSON catalogs — spec §17
- **Secrets:** **Phase** (`SlugBase` app — `.phase.json`; envs `Development` / `Staging` / `Production`) — decision #34
- **Bot protection:** **Altcha** (self-hosted PoW) on Cloud API; noop on CE — spec §11.8

### Cloud infrastructure (settled — spec §14.7)

| Layer | Platform | Notes |
|---|---|---|
| API / web / marketing / admin | **Coolify** on mdg-labs EU servers | Four container images from private registry |
| Container registry | **berth.mdg-labs.dev** (private) | CI in `slugbase-cloud`; Coolify pulls |
| Database | **PostgreSQL** (operator-hosted) | Coolify-managed or external |

**Image naming:** `{REGISTRY}/slugbase-cloud/{api|web|marketing|admin}:{version}` with `:dev` on staging.

CE: **split GHCR images** (`slugbase-api` + `slugbase-web`) — workflows in public `slugbase` — spec §14.2, §22.8.

### CI/CD (settled — spec §22, decision #35)

- **slugbase:** `pr.yml`, `staging.yml`, `main.yml` — CE CI + GHCR publish
- **slugbase-cloud:** `ci.yml`, `deploy.yml`, `build-and-push-cloud-image.yml` — Cloud deploy
- **commerce:** package CI + GitHub Packages publish

Secrets via **GitHub Actions environments** (`ci`, `staging`, `production`) — Phase syncs operator edits.

## Repository state

CE application code lives in public **`slugbase`** (`staging`). Cloud and billing code in private repos. Phased build history: `docs/internal/slugbase-development-roadmap.md` (P1–P6). Open-core split: `docs/internal/open-core-refactor-plan.md`.

## Spec doc precedence (when docs conflict)

1. `docs/internal/slugbase-mvp-spec.md` — **product source of truth**
2. `docs/internal/engineering-decisions.md` — **engineering source of truth**; spec wins on product conflicts
3. `docs/internal/design-prototype/V1/` — **visual & interaction-design source of truth**; spec wins on product conflicts (§23.4)

## Hard rules

- If a behaviour is not defined in a spec doc, **ask before guessing**.
- Never invent fields, endpoints, flows, or plans not present in the spec.
- **"Workspace"** is the only tenant term — "organization" is deprecated (spec §3, decision #1).
- **"Folder"** is the only container term — no "collection" (spec §3, decision #2).
- **"Pinning"** is the only prominence mechanism — no "favorites" anywhere (spec §3, decision #3).
- Bookmark editing is modal-only — no dedicated detail route (spec §6.2, decision #19).
- Slugs are private to a workspace — no anonymous `/go` resolution in v1 (spec §8.2, decision #23).
- All user-facing strings must be i18n keys — no hardcoded English or German (spec §17).
- UI follows the V1 design prototype + tokens; paid tier is **"Personal"** not "Pro"; Free cap is **50** (spec §23.4).
- pnpm throughout each repo — no npm or yarn lockfiles (spec §2.2).
- **No cloud/billing commits on public `slugbase`** except CE-strip tasks — cloud features go in `slugbase-cloud` / `commerce`.
- CE and Cloud share code paths — no `SLUGBASE_MODE`/`isCloud`/edition branches in app logic; use entitlements + module selection (spec §1, §15).
